utor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The mandatory node-restart protocol is also complete: a healthy pre-restart state and boot ID were captured, the restart was acknowledged, a distinct post-restart boot ID was observed and independently confirmed, and the running system, crond service, access policy, functional authorization behavior, OS, and kernel all recovered correctly.","limitations":["Lifecycle snapshots do not independently inventory /etc/cron.allow or local accounts, so those final-state conclusions rely on direct executor command evidence. No contradictory evidence was observed."]}
